{"id":"vod_md_5180","vodId":"5180","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"小林家的龙女仆国语版","name_cn":"小林家的龙女仆国语版","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230918-1/def09e08368ed8d85c548b9c4ac7f610.jpg"},"summary":"小林（田村睦心 配音）是一位非常平凡的程序员，在一次偶然之中救了一条名叫托尔（桑原由气 配音）的龙，为了报答小林的救命之恩，托尔化身成为了女仆的样子来到了小林家中，就这样，小林和龙女仆的同居生活就此拉开序幕。古灵精怪我行我素的康娜卡姆依（长绳麻理亚 配音）、对人类有着非常深的成见，但似乎不太聪明的样子的艾露玛（高田忧希 配音）、心思细腻温柔又稳重的大姐姐露科亚（高桥未奈美 配音）、痛恨着人类，但又无法自持的被人类所发明出来的游戏所吸引的法夫纳（小野大辅 配音），自托尔之后，小林的身边接二连三的出现了这些性格迥异的龙族们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-18 08:19:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/7BUgMjl5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/RdZkCB5A/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/6CTMOrHF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/IzlHNNJE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/vudMclww/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/tJvHKXYF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/0PkFx9s9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/ArY1BH2y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/V33XngSd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/RxaAqHgw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/fXE0H61X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/R948pWnX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/s6HFmlnF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230916/0YQ43Y53/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:56.834Z"}